WEBVTT

00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:18.593
KLARAH, ven zent ir geborn gevorn?

00:01:17.923 --> 00:01:19.790
geboyrn in Shtefanesht.

00:01:19.797 --> 00:01:20.702
ven?

00:01:22.513 --> 00:01:26.422
ikh bin geblibn a kind fun tsvey yor un a bruderl

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.768
fun a yor.

00:01:29.938 --> 00:01:33.712
di muter iz geshtorbn bay der zibn un tsvantsik yor.

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:38.606
der muter's muter hot mir genumen, di babe, ⟨vos zi⟩ hot mir UNK gekhovet.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:43.348
fun Shtefanesht zenen mir geforn keyn UNK, bin ikh gekhovet gevorn dortn.

00:01:43.557 --> 00:01:46.419
ven, ven zent ir geborn gevorn?

00:01:46.797 --> 00:01:49.845
ven ikh bin geboyrn? toyznt nayn hundert akht.

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:52.882
ir gedenkt dem tog, di monat?

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.956
yo, d- d- d- d-

00:01:53.956 --> 00:01:57.978
toyznt nayn hundert akht un zibetsntn detsember.

00:01:57.445 --> 00:01:58.164
zibe-

00:01:59.605 --> 00:02:00.544
un

00:02:00.702 --> 00:02:02.234
vos, vos

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:04.728
gedenkstu fun dayn shtub?

00:02:04.853 --> 00:02:06.635
ikh gedenk shtark

00:02:07.671 --> 00:02:12.018
shver ge⟨UNK⟩ bay der alter babe. zi hot shver gearbet vegn maynet vegn.

00:02:11.772 --> 00:02:13.521
UNK hot zi geheysn?

00:02:13.155 --> 00:02:14.195
Toybe.

00:02:14.522 --> 00:02:15.815
Toybe vos?

00:02:16.395 --> 00:02:19.173
vi, vos iz geven der tsveyter nomen?

00:02:19.146 --> 00:02:26.953
⟨der zeyde⟩ iz geven bay di akhtsik yor ven er iz geshtorbn, azoy gedenk ikh, vayl er hot mikh gelernt in kheyder, hot er mir gelernt, heyst es.

00:02:27.904 --> 00:02:30.395
vos iz geven ir familye nomen?

00:02:30.621 --> 00:02:32.623
dem bobe's familye nomen?

00:02:31.937 --> 00:02:33.787
di muter's mame hot gehat

00:02:33.827 --> 00:02:35.376
tsvey shvester.

00:02:35.376 --> 00:02:38.321
hot di bobe di ale dray tekhters farloyrn

00:02:38.321 --> 00:02:42.646
un hot geholfn di dray eyniklekh, ⟨vifl⟩ di dray tekhter, di kinder.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:45.515
eyn un eyntsikn feter hob ikh gehat

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.227
iz er gefaln bay

00:02:48.227 --> 00:02:49.329
MOGILOV

00:02:50.314 --> 00:02:52.670
opgesho- opgeshosn im.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:54.274
du gegen- du gedenkst dem nomen?

00:02:53.554 --> 00:02:55.083
Yankl.

00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:58.461
vi hot, vi hot dayn fa- dayn foter geheysn? Zalmen.

00:02:56.828 --> 00:02:58.087
Zalmen.

00:02:58.461 --> 00:03:00.298
un vos iz mit im geven?

00:03:00.085 --> 00:03:02.357
geshtorbn in der milkhome.

00:03:02.835 --> 00:03:03.757
voser

00:03:03.797 --> 00:03:06.609
vi far dem, vos hot er gemakht?

00:03:06.565 --> 00:03:08.077
er iz geven a shnayder.

00:03:07.135 --> 00:03:10.743
geven a shnayder. fun vanet iz er geven?

00:03:10.412 --> 00:03:11.986
oykh a Shtefaneshter.

00:03:11.986 --> 00:03:16.008
di eltern Shtefaneshter. di eltern's eltern Shtefaneshter.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.434
un vi hot dayn mame geheysn?

00:03:19.356 --> 00:03:20.413
Feyge.

00:03:21.685 --> 00:03:24.733
Feyge. fun shtub vi hot zi geheysn?

00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:27.146
f- fun der shtub

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.082
Itsik. di familye Itsik.

00:03:30.004 --> 00:03:32.900
Feyge Itsik. un dernokh dem iz zi ge-

00:03:31.135 --> 00:03:32.243
yo

00:03:33.075 --> 00:03:34.756
iz geven Ite

00:03:34.678 --> 00:03:37.473
dernokh dem hot zi g- khasene gehat mit NADLER.

00:03:38.222 --> 00:03:39.375
dernokh dem

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:42.772
hot zi khasene gehat? iz zi geven NADLER?

00:03:40.467 --> 00:03:41.575
yo

00:03:42.981 --> 00:03:43.920
neyn.

00:03:44.905 --> 00:03:46.451
⟨zi⟩ hot khasene gehat

00:03:46.947 --> 00:03:53.134
⟨hot⟩ zi genumen dem tsveyt- dem man, iz er, iz zi geven di tsveyte bay im, hot zi genumen di kinder.

00:03:54.523 --> 00:03:56.913
ober der nomen iz geven NADLER?

00:03:56.802 --> 00:03:58.196
NADLER.

00:04:01.172 --> 00:04:04.575
un du gedenkst dayn m- muter?

00:04:04.463 --> 00:04:05.436
vi azoy?

00:04:04.986 --> 00:04:06.752
du gedenkst di muter?

00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:09.637
neyn. tsvey yor bin ikh alt geven.

00:04:10.318 --> 00:04:13.197
kh'hob geefnt di oygn oyf der UNK babe

00:04:13.204 --> 00:04:15.546
un oyfn feter. UNK

00:04:15.546 --> 00:04:17.180
⟨dem⟩ feter hob ikh nisht keyn bild.

00:04:17.793 --> 00:04:19.744
vi hot geheysn dayn feter?

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.758
Yankl.

00:04:20.442 --> 00:04:21.431
Yankl.

00:04:22.131 --> 00:04:26.529
er, er iz gefaln. m'hot im opgeshosn bay MOGILOV.

00:04:27.615 --> 00:04:30.646
vos gedenkstu fun dem shtub fun dayn babe?

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.646
fun der shtub dos gedenk ikh, di bobe mitn zeydn

00:04:34.703 --> 00:04:36.817
ikh gedenk dem feter

00:04:36.817 --> 00:04:39.523
un der f- der foter mayner hot gehat

00:04:39.816 --> 00:04:42.876
finef brider in Shtefanesht ale

00:04:42.876 --> 00:04:45.976
ale finef sh- ale finef shnayder geven.

00:04:47.072 --> 00:04:49.968
ir hot gevoynt in a kleyner shtub?

00:04:50.717 --> 00:04:53.844
gevoynt mit der babe mitn zeydn in a kleyn shtibele.

00:04:53.316 --> 00:04:55.892
a kleyn shtibele. vos iz geven in dem shtub?

00:04:53.844 --> 00:04:54.862
yo

00:04:56.691 --> 00:04:58.170
vos iz geven in dem?

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.535
bay di, yene tsaytn

00:05:00.535 --> 00:05:03.587
tsvey GEWOHNEN, eyns akegn dos andere.

00:05:04.015 --> 00:05:07.046
keyn shafe iz nisht geven. m'hot nisht gehat vos arayntsuleygn

00:05:08.689 --> 00:05:10.877
yeder eyner hot gelernt mit kinder sh-

00:05:11.068 --> 00:05:12.614
di talmed toyre.

00:05:12.655 --> 00:05:14.353
dos iz geven in gantsn.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.631
s'iz geven vaser in shtub?

00:05:18.088 --> 00:05:23.161
in sh- neyn. me fleg brengen fun droysn, ariber akegn dortn, dos gedenk ikh.

00:05:22.965 --> 00:05:25.001
ver hot gebrakht di vaser?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.650
oder di babe oder der zeyde mit di keselekh.

00:05:29.817 --> 00:05:34.920
un di, vos hot zi gemakht, di babe? zi hot ge- zi iz geven in shtub?

00:05:33.985 --> 00:05:41.100
di babe iz geven in shtub. zi hot gehaltn in UNK kinder UNK gelernt fun besere pletser.

00:05:42.186 --> 00:05:43.614
un der zeyde?

00:05:43.992 --> 00:05:46.849
der zeyde hot ge- UNK mit yidishkeyt.

00:05:46.849 --> 00:05:50.819
bay yene, bay yene tsaytn iz geven yidishkeyt. nisht hayntike tsaytn.

00:05:50.819 --> 00:05:52.399
haynt iz nokhgemakht.

00:05:53.323 --> 00:05:55.882
un er hot oykhet gearbet?

00:05:55.956 --> 00:05:59.530
der zeyde? an alter mentsh, nor melamed

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.877
mit di kinder.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.205
un s'iz geven a sakh yidishe mishpokhes?

00:06:07.397 --> 00:06:08.403
vi azoy?

00:06:07.802 --> 00:06:09.247
a sakh yidn?

00:06:10.317 --> 00:06:13.180
in Shtefanesht? nor yidn iz geven.

00:06:13.219 --> 00:06:19.355
nor yidn. geven UNK damolst, der ⟨emesdiker⟩, der alter rebe zol zikh, zol UNK zayn.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:24.519
ikh fleg iberlign baym rebn, ⟨nor⟩ vi a khosid, nisht keyn meydele.

00:06:25.521 --> 00:06:26.730
un ir

00:06:26.905 --> 00:06:30.493
di, ir hot gegangen tsum BET HAKNESET?

00:06:30.128 --> 00:06:33.429
y- b- BETACH, BETACH.

00:06:33.334 --> 00:06:34.425
ven?

00:06:34.633 --> 00:06:37.010
nor oyf shabes oder

00:06:36.051 --> 00:06:42.154
tsvey mol in tog. in der fri baym UNK in der fri, un oyf der nakht ⟨bay minkhe mayrev⟩ geven in der shul.

00:06:42.379 --> 00:06:47.849
ikh fleg loyfn montik un donershtik mit di likht ontsindn. ikh tsind on likht vegn mayne kinder

00:06:47.849 --> 00:06:50.049
vegn di yunge, vayl far mir

00:06:50.049 --> 00:06:53.718
Toybe, far mir hot nisht, far undz hot nisht ver ontsutsindn

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.218
un

00:06:58.545 --> 00:07:03.545
s'iz geven a shul az zey z- az di kinder zenen gegangen

00:07:03.545 --> 00:07:05.306
a yidishe shul oder

00:07:04.603 --> 00:07:07.533
a yidishe shule. a yidishe shule.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.890
nu, un du host oykhet geven in dem shul?

00:07:09.447 --> 00:07:14.615
ikh bin geven in di shule a halb yor, nisht mer, vayl di babe iz geforn mit mir keyn UNK

00:07:14.615 --> 00:07:19.475
hot der ⟨eygn un⟩ eyntsiker feter, mir ho'mir gemakht a, a kleyt

00:07:19.475 --> 00:07:20.814
in a dorf

00:07:20.972 --> 00:07:23.008
bin ikh gangen in dorf in shule.

00:07:24.617 --> 00:07:26.231
a, nor a halbe yor?

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.075
bite?

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.256
a halbe yor?

00:07:28.583 --> 00:07:31.884
in shu- in, in dorf bin ikh gegangen merert

00:07:31.975 --> 00:07:34.517
ober in dorf iz geven nor kristn.

00:07:34.978 --> 00:07:39.562
i- s'iz geven in yedn dorf a yid mit a kleyt, yedn dorf, ober nor mit kristn.

00:07:40.227 --> 00:07:43.781
un vi zaynen geven di batsiungen mit di kristn?

00:07:43.399 --> 00:07:44.405
vi azoy?

00:07:44.142 --> 00:07:47.460
vi azoy g- v- vi- vos batsiungen

00:07:47.652 --> 00:07:49.586
zaynen geven mit di kristn?

00:07:49.238 --> 00:07:50.720
gut.

00:07:50.328 --> 00:07:51.018
gut?

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.137
gut, gut, gut.

00:07:52.137 --> 00:07:54.801
nokh beser vi haynt a yid mitn andern.

00:07:57.996 --> 00:08:00.082
me holt geholfn eyn-

00:07:59.717 --> 00:08:01.314
n- yo, yo.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:07.085
un take dem, dem feter's kinder zenen geven dortn in shule ongezen groys

00:08:08.104 --> 00:08:10.781
un biz ven zent ir dortn geven?

00:08:13.015 --> 00:08:16.468
a shviger mit a shnur kumt nisht oys keyn mol.

00:08:16.795 --> 00:08:23.016
tsi s'iz geven t- tsi s'iz geven in UNK tsi s'iz geven in dorf, dos iz geven, vu zi fleg forn ⟨kon⟩ zi mikh mitnemen

00:08:23.764 --> 00:08:26.812
vu zi fleg forn, hobn mir geholfn bay ir UNK.

00:08:29.772 --> 00:08:33.495
un vos hostu gemakht az du bist geven a bisl elter?

00:08:33.332 --> 00:08:34.372
vi azoy?

00:08:33.736 --> 00:08:35.660
vos hostu gemakht

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.421
ven du bist geven elter, nisht a kind?

00:08:37.787 --> 00:08:40.498
ikh bin geven elter, UNK geven a ⟨kikhner⟩

00:08:40.774 --> 00:08:43.822
bay YOSIPOVITSH, ⟨iz zi⟩ geven a milyoner

00:08:44.284 --> 00:08:45.797
emesdike milyoner.

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.231
tsen yor.

00:08:47.828 --> 00:08:49.596
ikh bin geven lebn ir.

00:08:49.596 --> 00:08:51.950
ikh hob shoyn nisht gelernt in shule

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.441
oder

00:08:53.515 --> 00:08:55.461
di pritse, di baleboste

00:08:55.461 --> 00:08:59.890
genumen a f- m- a, a moral, zol mikh lernen ⟨PRATI⟩, ikh zol nisht zayn

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.828
oyfgevaksn azoy ot o.

00:09:01.969 --> 00:09:03.189
az di babe

00:09:03.189 --> 00:09:06.496
iz blind geborn oyf eyn oyg fun di fayern

00:09:06.496 --> 00:09:08.530
es iz ir nokhgekumen dos andere

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.249
hot zi nisht gekont arbetn

00:09:10.288 --> 00:09:13.674
zenen mir gezesn bay a MISHPACHA ayngedungen

00:09:13.731 --> 00:09:16.678
un der f- zun irer fleg undz helfn.

00:09:18.338 --> 00:09:19.800
vos hostu gemakht?

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:22.331
vos far a arbet hostu gedarft makhn?

00:09:21.679 --> 00:09:22.719
ver?

00:09:22.516 --> 00:09:23.116
du.

00:09:22.776 --> 00:09:23.799
ikh?

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.283
bay a sh- bay a shnayder gezesn

00:09:26.283 --> 00:09:30.414
un geneyt aza min UNK vegn, vegn di goyishe ⟨semones⟩

00:09:30.927 --> 00:09:32.169
dos hob ikh getun.

00:09:33.188 --> 00:09:34.397
a sakh yorn?

00:09:35.026 --> 00:09:36.226
yo.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.738
biz ven?

00:09:39.921 --> 00:09:41.619
biz di babe iz geshtorbn.

00:09:42.148 --> 00:09:43.694
vifl bistu

00:09:43.853 --> 00:09:46.361
alt geven ven zi iz geshtorbn?

00:09:46.198 --> 00:09:48.689
fir, finef un tsvantsik yor.

00:09:49.978 --> 00:09:52.233
un ven hostu khasene gehat?

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.465
ikh?

00:09:57.167 --> 00:09:59.152
vifl alt bistu geven?

00:09:59.901 --> 00:10:02.882
zibn UNK akht un tsvantsik yor, aza min.

00:10:03.124 --> 00:10:05.140
UNK BIDIUK gedenk ikh nit.

00:10:05.233 --> 00:10:07.302
un ver iz geven dayn man?

00:10:08.558 --> 00:10:09.986
fun Botshan.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.601
vi, vi hot er geheysn?

00:10:11.882 --> 00:10:13.816
Srol ROSENZWEIG.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.635
vos hot er gemakht?

00:10:16.692 --> 00:10:17.783
meler.

00:10:19.392 --> 00:10:21.799
un ir, vu zent ir gevoynt?

00:10:22.058 --> 00:10:25.528
vu hot ir gevoynt? in Botshan.

00:10:22.918 --> 00:10:24.498
in Botshan.

00:10:24.657 --> 00:10:25.258
yo.

00:10:28.065 --> 00:10:29.960
er iz geven a meler, un

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.924
du host gearbet in shtub?

00:10:31.423 --> 00:10:32.525
in shtub.

00:10:32.525 --> 00:10:35.063
nisht gegangen arbetn keyn mol gornisht.

00:10:37.482 --> 00:10:39.146
un

00:10:40.924 --> 00:10:44.017
vos kenstu mir dertseyln oyf dayn

00:10:44.017 --> 00:10:45.846
lebn fun dem tsayt?

00:10:46.577 --> 00:10:47.752
fun danet?

00:10:47.353 --> 00:10:48.207
neyn.

00:10:47.978 --> 00:10:51.246
fun dortn. a shtark shver lebn.

00:10:48.433 --> 00:10:49.473
in Botshan.

00:10:51.606 --> 00:10:52.936
shver.

00:10:51.606 --> 00:10:53.026
v- far vos?

00:10:52.936 --> 00:10:55.298
m'hot nisht gehat mit vos ibertsukumen

00:10:55.298 --> 00:10:58.013
UNK

00:10:58.137 --> 00:11:00.353
UNK ⟨avek⟩geforn di mener

00:11:00.353 --> 00:11:02.147
shtark shver gelebt.

00:11:02.254 --> 00:11:03.668
shtark shver.

00:11:03.668 --> 00:11:06.905
a shvester zayner flegn mir a sakh helfn.

00:11:07.452 --> 00:11:08.948
vi hot zi geheysn?

00:11:08.616 --> 00:11:09.791
BRACHA.

00:11:09.375 --> 00:11:10.196
BRACHA.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.515
a sakh geholfn.

00:11:11.515 --> 00:11:15.022
mitn letstn shtikl tsuker fleg men zikh teyln mit mir

00:11:15.079 --> 00:11:18.093
mitn shtikl broyt UNK ⟨mir⟩

00:11:18.876 --> 00:11:21.536
haynt zenen mir oykhet in di beste k-

00:11:21.627 --> 00:11:26.500
zi kumt tsun undz. undz kumen mir tsu zey. di kinder ire kumen tsun undz

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.691
mir haltn mir zikh shtark gebundn.

00:11:28.748 --> 00:11:31.104
nokh gikher vi tsvey shvester.

00:11:33.878 --> 00:11:35.419
un

00:11:35.419 --> 00:11:37.365
du host gehat brider?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:42.393
kh'hob gehat brider, ober fun eyn tatn, nisht fun eyn mamen.

00:11:42.703 --> 00:11:45.312
vi ze- vi hobn zey geheysn?

00:11:45.015 --> 00:11:46.151
MARCO

00:11:46.151 --> 00:11:47.389
der groyser

00:11:47.395 --> 00:11:49.515
un der tsveyter Srol

00:11:49.943 --> 00:11:53.160
un vos kenstu dertseyln oyf MARCO un Srol?

00:11:53.217 --> 00:11:58.999
MARCO iz geven a shnayder. Srol iz koydem geven, ⟨er iz geven⟩ bay a MISADA.

00:11:59.443 --> 00:12:01.833
nokh hot er gehat a kleyt in a dorf

00:12:02.667 --> 00:12:04.230
un

00:12:04.776 --> 00:12:06.339
a shvester

00:12:06.362 --> 00:12:08.617
⟨hob ikh⟩ gehat a farheyrate

00:12:08.691 --> 00:12:13.393
der man iz geven a shnayder, oykh gevoynt in Botshan. zi iz shoyn nishto. er iz nishto.

00:12:13.872 --> 00:12:17.089
un vos iz geven mit MARCO un

00:12:17.095 --> 00:12:18.000
un di

00:12:17.837 --> 00:12:22.606
MARCO iz shoyn geven oyf di eltere yorn, un iz er geforn tsu dem zun keyn Bukaresht

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.368
hot men nisht gekont dos firn tsu haltn dort oykh nit

00:12:25.368 --> 00:12:28.057
iz er arayn in a BET UNK dortn

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.437
un dort iz er geshtorbn.

00:12:31.219 --> 00:12:32.478
in YISRAEL?

00:12:33.548 --> 00:12:34.875
in Yisroel?

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.166
elterer m- elterer mentsh.

00:12:39.049 --> 00:12:40.561
shvakh geven.

00:12:41.783 --> 00:12:46.699
geven, geven, geven andersh t- andersh ⟨tsum⟩ lebn in dorf. vi azoy mir UNK dos gemuzt

00:12:46.699 --> 00:12:47.936
farshvaygn.

00:12:48.448 --> 00:12:51.817
zey zenen oykhet geven mit di bobe dayne?

00:12:52.363 --> 00:12:53.521
neyn.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:53.900
neyn.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.374
er iz shoyn geven gresere kinder.

00:12:58.033 --> 00:13:02.313
un zey v- zey hobn gevoynt in der zelber plats?

00:13:02.016 --> 00:13:03.545
Botshan ale.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.071
du host gehat a kind.

00:13:11.263 --> 00:13:12.286
yo.

00:13:12.765 --> 00:13:14.311
vi hot zi geheysn?

00:13:14.166 --> 00:13:16.573
Feygele, nokh mayn mame's nomen.

00:13:17.102 --> 00:13:19.239
un vos, vos i-

00:13:19.532 --> 00:13:23.022
kh'hob es nisht gehat mit vos tsu khoven. kh'hob nit gehat mit vos es afile

00:13:23.022 --> 00:13:25.567
hob ikh keyn milekh tsu koyfn tsu gebn es.

00:13:27.598 --> 00:13:29.954
far- fardorbn gevorn.

00:13:29.961 --> 00:13:31.608
ven iz dos geven?

00:13:35.682 --> 00:13:39.422
ikh kon nit gedenken ⟨mit⟩ vifl yorn ken ikh nit UNK dos aykh

00:13:39.664 --> 00:13:41.683
ober danken got do in land

00:13:41.757 --> 00:13:44.484
shoyn zeks NITUCHIM durkhgegangen.

00:13:44.558 --> 00:13:47.471
eyn in Rumenye, nisht mer, un do zeks.

00:13:49.198 --> 00:13:50.039
vos

00:13:50.039 --> 00:13:52.854
gedenkstu fun di tsayt fun dem krig?

00:13:52.995 --> 00:13:54.086
fun vos?

00:13:53.586 --> 00:13:56.077
fun dem tsayt fun dem krig.

00:13:56.674 --> 00:13:59.435
fun der krig? geven a shver lebn.

00:13:59.733 --> 00:14:00.313
bist

00:13:59.863 --> 00:14:04.126
un ven s'iz arayngekumen di rusn iz geven nokh, nokh arger.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:10.961
m'hot nisht gehat mit vos ibertsukumen, un me fleg betn di kristn ⟨vos mir zenen⟩ geven shkheynim

00:14:11.018 --> 00:14:14.373
⟨ikh⟩ zol konen koyfn a shtikl broyt vegn der sh- vegn undz

00:14:14.373 --> 00:14:16.766
vayl di, di, nu

00:14:18.325 --> 00:14:21.266
di MISHTARistn dortn flegn ⟨zikh shteln in⟩ di gasn

00:14:21.266 --> 00:14:24.590
az m'hot gedarft koyfn a bisl milekh, tsi a shtikl kez

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:27.611
fleg men nemen un fartraybn di yidn fun dortn

00:14:27.611 --> 00:14:28.809
un ven ⟨zi hot⟩

00:14:28.809 --> 00:14:30.471
m'hot ge⟨UNK⟩ in gantsn

00:14:30.471 --> 00:14:33.219
flegn zey makhn khoyzek ⟨vi ir zent⟩

00:14:33.462 --> 00:14:36.645
UNK di ⟨shof⟩. UNK ⟨geyst⟩ koyfn.

00:14:36.702 --> 00:14:38.774
bin ikh gegangen koyfn a bisl neft

00:14:38.774 --> 00:14:42.382
hob ikh gekhapt vider a s- a MISHTARist dortn

00:14:42.388 --> 00:14:46.494
PERSA geven a UNK a gezunter zhlob a UNK

00:14:46.494 --> 00:14:48.660
hot er UNK mit di UNK

00:14:49.088 --> 00:14:50.364
veyst vos UNK ⟨zogn⟩?

00:14:50.438 --> 00:14:56.628
g- gehakt ⟨IMMER⟩. far a krist UNK "UITE, E O UNK⟩," kuk, a yidishke iz do dortn.

00:14:56.628 --> 00:14:58.329
mitn shal ibern kop

00:14:59.989 --> 00:15:03.816
ikh hob gehaltn, UNK gegangen UNK di gele gehat

00:15:03.816 --> 00:15:05.150
hob ikh mikh ibergedekt

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.800
er hot mikh yo derkont.

00:15:07.482 --> 00:15:09.956
vos ikh gedenk, dos UNK ikh aykh entfern.

00:15:10.097 --> 00:15:14.850
un di gantse tsayt in, fun krig, bist geven in der zelber plats?

00:15:14.569 --> 00:15:15.676
vi azoy?

00:15:15.379 --> 00:15:17.820
der gantser tsayt fun der krig

00:15:17.961 --> 00:15:20.216
bistu geven in der zelber plats?

00:15:20.087 --> 00:15:21.616
oyf ⟨dem zelbn⟩ plats.

00:15:21.673 --> 00:15:23.574
vu? d- in Botshan?

00:15:22.888 --> 00:15:24.164
in Botshan.

00:15:24.357 --> 00:15:26.072
di gantse tsayt dortn

00:15:25.572 --> 00:15:31.759
du gedenkst ah dem nomen fun dem plats vu der UNK

00:15:32.473 --> 00:15:36.146
vu bist, hostu gevoynt, gedenkst dem nomen?

00:15:39.595 --> 00:15:41.460
ikh gedenk nit.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:43.402
ikh gedenk nit.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.198
ikh gedenk nisht. ikh ge- dos iz geven UNK.

00:15:48.198 --> 00:15:54.658
ikh hob gevoynt ale yorn UNK dortn UNK fun dort bin ikh aroysgeforn in land arayn ahertsu.

00:15:55.609 --> 00:15:57.858
mit vemen host- bistu geven

00:15:57.858 --> 00:16:01.475
d- in dem tsayt fun dem krig? ver iz mit dir geven?

00:16:01.482 --> 00:16:02.454
vi azoy?

00:16:02.173 --> 00:16:04.192
ver iz mit dir geven

00:16:04.468 --> 00:16:08.140
in der tsayt fun dem krig in shtub? ver iz geven?

00:16:07.168 --> 00:16:10.785
di sh- di ge- di gevezene shvegerin, dem man's shvester.

00:16:10.785 --> 00:16:13.873
zi hot gehat dem e- ir man's eltern

00:16:13.873 --> 00:16:15.988
fleg ikh mikh nemen tsu zikh

00:16:16.264 --> 00:16:17.889
un mit vos zey hobn gehat

00:16:17.889 --> 00:16:19.880
vos m- ⟨fir⟩ alte mentshn

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:23.340
hot er geshlept vegn maynet vegn UNK hobn mit vos ibertsukumen

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:25.399
az zi hot nisht geholfn gornit.

00:16:25.399 --> 00:16:30.686
ikh hob gemuzt ib- farshraybn. ikh hob genumen di kantines yedn tog geyn nemen esn.

00:16:31.806 --> 00:16:33.757
vos ikh gedenk, azoy hob ikh aykh

00:16:37.965 --> 00:16:40.541
UNK gedenk nisht di gas vu ikh hob gevoynt.

00:16:43.416 --> 00:16:45.671
un vos iz geven mit dayn man?

00:16:47.702 --> 00:16:52.218
mayn man UNK geven avekgeshikt vi ale mener funem, fun der shtot

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.246
un dort ven er iz krik gekumen

00:16:54.246 --> 00:16:55.875
hobn mir gevoynt tsuzamen

00:16:55.875 --> 00:16:59.087
nokh dem UNK untergekumen epes a sh- a UNK

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.536
iz haynt a bisl, morgn a bisl, biz vanet m'hot

00:17:03.536 --> 00:17:06.342
⟨zi⟩ hot gehat brider in Amerike

00:17:06.483 --> 00:17:08.261
iz zi avekgeforn dortn.

00:17:08.261 --> 00:17:12.030
vos er hot gehandlt veys ikh nit. m'hot im avekgeharget

00:17:12.508 --> 00:17:14.223
oyf der gas, yo.

00:17:14.702 --> 00:17:17.075
dos veys ikh. fun epes andersh veys ikh nit.

00:17:19.258 --> 00:17:24.196
un in dem tsayt fun dem krig iz er geven, hot er gearbet

00:17:24.117 --> 00:17:25.073
yo

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.420
in a m- in a

00:17:25.435 --> 00:17:29.141
neyn, UNK krig iz er nisht geven in der heym.

00:17:28.786 --> 00:17:30.316
nisht in der heym.

00:17:29.316 --> 00:17:31.886
avekgeshikt. gearbet bay di

00:17:30.316 --> 00:17:31.576
yo, avekgeshikt.

00:17:31.886 --> 00:17:33.545
shteyner, bay di

00:17:42.141 --> 00:17:43.960
un v- vos hostu gemakht

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.020
nokh dem

00:17:45.195 --> 00:17:46.556
nokhn krig?

00:17:47.355 --> 00:17:48.682
nokhn krig?

00:17:49.414 --> 00:17:53.087
fleg ikh raybn ⟨felekher⟩. ⟨ir veyst vos⟩ dos heyst?

00:17:54.257 --> 00:17:57.305
fun di lemlekh, far di, far di sokhrim

00:17:57.902 --> 00:18:00.241
lemer dortn vos zenen geven di felekhlekh

00:18:00.315 --> 00:18:01.502
raybn azoy.

00:18:01.502 --> 00:18:02.942
mit dem hob ikh gelebt.

00:18:04.517 --> 00:18:05.658
biz ven?

00:18:06.357 --> 00:18:07.330
vi azoy?

00:18:06.407 --> 00:18:07.936
biz ven?

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.029
vif-

00:18:09.816 --> 00:18:13.860
biz ikh bin aroysgeforn, biz vanet er iz krik gekumen fun der krig

00:18:14.018 --> 00:18:16.250
un dernokh dem hot er nokh UNK ⟨gearbet⟩

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.984
biz vanet undz ze'mir aroysgeforn funem land

00:18:18.984 --> 00:18:21.099
fun Rumenye oyf ahertsu.

00:18:21.679 --> 00:18:23.647
vayl mir ho'mir ⟨geplagt⟩ zikh

00:18:24.362 --> 00:18:27.883
anderthalbn yor, ariber anderthalbn yor, biz undz ze'mir gekumen

00:18:27.906 --> 00:18:28.814
vayl

00:18:28.814 --> 00:18:32.844
ale mol hob ikh fardreyt pletser. ikh vil nisht forn. ikh bin e-

00:18:33.137 --> 00:18:36.472
bin geven oyf a sakh UNK oyf a sakh pletser

00:18:37.204 --> 00:18:38.733
UNK dermanen.

00:18:42.115 --> 00:18:44.944
SATU MARE gedenk ikh vi se ruft zikh on

00:18:45.388 --> 00:18:47.845
UNK fun vanet iz ⟨der⟩ FRITZ?

00:18:49.371 --> 00:18:51.255
fun vanet iz FRITZ?

00:18:56.965 --> 00:18:58.545
ikh gedenk nit ⟨fun⟩ vanet.

00:19:00.205 --> 00:19:05.177
ikh gedenk nisht di pletser. nor fun AUSTRIA ven ikh bin arayngekumen keyn GERMANIA

00:19:05.183 --> 00:19:08.501
dortn zenen zey geven gut un gut un nokh a mol gut.

00:19:08.625 --> 00:19:11.805
vayl der, s'iz nisht geven keyn JOINT.

00:19:11.805 --> 00:19:14.125
di ⟨UNRRA⟩ hot ibergenumen

00:19:14.262 --> 00:19:18.339
un m'hot geshtelt fremde nemen, nisht oyf mayn nomen, nisht oyf zayn nomen.

00:19:18.649 --> 00:19:21.832
iz fun dortn zenen mir ge- hot men undz aribergenumen nokh a

00:19:22.058 --> 00:19:23.824
karge anderthalbn yor

00:19:23.948 --> 00:19:25.967
zenen mir shoyn durkh MARSIL.

00:19:26.513 --> 00:19:31.041
in MARSIL hot men undz zeyer sheyn oyfgenumen, un fun dortn zenen mir gekumen in land arayn.

00:19:31.041 --> 00:19:32.576
ober biz MARSIL

00:19:32.576 --> 00:19:34.539
iz geven biter.

00:19:36.132 --> 00:19:40.935
dos iz geven a, a MACHANE? vos iz dos geven? vu zent ir geven

00:19:40.941 --> 00:19:44.900
in di pletser? vu hot ir gevoynt? vos iz dos geven?

00:19:44.113 --> 00:19:48.084
funem JOINT alding. funem JOINT alding iz geven. m'hot undz UNK

00:19:48.084 --> 00:19:53.164
esn, trinken, shlofn, ongetuekhts. ver es hot nisht gehat hot gehat. UNK

00:19:53.164 --> 00:19:54.269
fun ⟨UNRRA⟩

00:19:54.269 --> 00:19:55.937
vayl s'iz shoyn nisht geven keyn JOINT.

00:19:56.432 --> 00:19:58.670
m- mit vemen bistu geven? aleyn?

00:19:58.525 --> 00:20:00.682
mit mayn, mitn man.

00:20:00.035 --> 00:20:01.135
mitn man.

00:20:00.682 --> 00:20:02.875
mitn man bin ikh gekumen ahertsu tsu

00:20:02.875 --> 00:20:04.796
un do nokh etlekhe yor

00:20:06.085 --> 00:20:10.989
ikh bin gekumen ⟨zog ikh dikh⟩ a UNK a Bukareshter, ⟨yene⟩ UNK

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:21.165
hot zi gehat brider in Amerike, hot zi ⟨gevolt kumen⟩ ahintsu tsu, un dortn vos er hot gehandlt shvartse zakhn, yene, yene zakhn

00:20:21.542 --> 00:20:23.142
hot men im avekgeharget

00:20:23.142 --> 00:20:28.462
m'hot im gemont krign di zakhn vos er hot ⟨gelign⟩ gelt oyf mashkones, hot men im avekgeharget.

00:20:29.929 --> 00:20:34.175
un az ir zent gekumen ahertsu in land, vu hot ir gevoynt?

00:20:35.886 --> 00:20:40.202
do. ven ikh ⟨bin⟩ gekumen fun UNK hot men mir gegibn koydem UNK

00:20:40.202 --> 00:20:41.448
AGROBANK

00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:43.913
dem

00:20:44.323 --> 00:20:45.751
vu hostu gevoynt?

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.807
do. do in land.

00:20:46.017 --> 00:20:47.847
vu? in ASHKELON?

00:20:48.087 --> 00:20:49.296
Yisroel.

00:20:50.415 --> 00:20:53.176
vi azoy ruft men on vu ⟨mir zenen⟩ gekumen ahertsu?

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:57.362
ikh ⟨vil⟩ gedenken ⟨nor⟩ tsurik di verter

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:03.938
vu bist- in vosere lager bistu geven do in land ⟨ven bist⟩ gekumen ⟨aher⟩?

00:21:03.938 --> 00:21:05.676
vu?

00:21:05.676 --> 00:21:09.647
bin geven UNK AGROBANK ⟨bin⟩ geven in CHADERA.

00:21:09.855 --> 00:21:11.101
fun AGROBANK

00:21:11.101 --> 00:21:13.219
hot men im oykhet avekgenumen

00:21:13.219 --> 00:21:15.581
ober er flegt merer zayn in der heym vi

00:21:15.581 --> 00:21:18.087
un fun AGROBANK bin ikh gekumen keyn AKO

00:21:18.087 --> 00:21:21.037
hob ikh dortn gevoynt biz ikh bin gekumen ahertsu.

00:21:20.537 --> 00:21:21.780
in AKO?

00:21:21.583 --> 00:21:22.488
yo.

00:21:22.377 --> 00:21:24.244
vos hot ir gehat in AKO?

00:21:24.958 --> 00:21:28.749
vos iz dos geven? a MAABARA, a shtub? vos iz d-

00:21:27.625 --> 00:21:30.184
neyn a, a arabishe sh-

00:21:29.571 --> 00:21:31.321
a arabishe shtub

00:21:30.291 --> 00:21:35.533
arabishe shtot. geven alte AKO un naye AKO, hot men gegibn in naye AKO

00:21:33.059 --> 00:21:34.009
yo

00:21:35.742 --> 00:21:37.220
dort hob ikh gevoynt.

00:21:36.906 --> 00:21:38.317
vos hot ir gemakht?

00:21:38.188 --> 00:21:40.105
er hot gearbet mileray.

00:21:38.745 --> 00:21:40.865
un du?

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:42.468
in shtub?

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:42.940
in shtub.

00:21:44.618 --> 00:21:47.075
un vifl yor bistu geven in AKO?

00:21:50.845 --> 00:21:54.450
ven bin ikh ⟨gekumen⟩? in akht un fuftsik bin ikh gekumen ahertsu, yo?

00:21:54.675 --> 00:21:56.947
akht un fertsik UNK

00:22:03.417 --> 00:22:05.410
a sakh zakhn gedenk ikh nit.

00:22:05.745 --> 00:22:07.477
opshteln azoy

00:22:09.475 --> 00:22:12.658
⟨farn⟩ akht un fertsikstn bin ikh gekumen in land.

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:19.897
a por yor zent ir geven in AKO? a por yor?

00:22:18.334 --> 00:22:19.087
bite?

00:22:19.498 --> 00:22:20.521
yo.

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.800
UNK dortn

00:22:23.464 --> 00:22:25.190
bin ikh gekumen ahertsu.

00:22:25.607 --> 00:22:28.166
un vos hot ir gemakht do in Ashkelon?

00:22:28.172 --> 00:22:29.094
vi azoy?

00:22:28.729 --> 00:22:30.815
in, in, do in Ashkelon?

00:22:30.957 --> 00:22:32.818
do bin ikh gekumen glaykh tsun im.

00:22:32.818 --> 00:22:34.950
funem akht un fuftsikstn

00:22:34.973 --> 00:22:37.734
hob ikh aribergeshpant di shvel do ot o

00:22:38.972 --> 00:22:41.905
UNK yorn ⟨di⟩ tsvey kinder geven

00:22:41.905 --> 00:22:44.940
BIDIUK a khoydesh nokh der bar mitsve

00:22:44.997 --> 00:22:46.408
arayngekumen

00:22:46.718 --> 00:22:49.682
iz ⟨der⟩ kind meg ikh ⟨shoyn hobn azan elter⟩

00:22:49.823 --> 00:22:54.761
dos meydele UNK keyn akht yor nisht geven, vayl di akht yor hob ikh ir gemakht dem YOM HULEDET

00:22:55.408 --> 00:22:56.384
dos i-

00:22:56.384 --> 00:22:59.464
do hob ikh nisht gearbet gornit. shtub.

00:22:59.464 --> 00:23:01.629
shtub un di kinder hob ikh aleyn gehat.

00:23:03.222 --> 00:23:07.623
ikh hob UNK s'iz nisht zayne kinder. ir hot kinder? yo, undz ho'mir tsvey kinder.

00:23:07.623 --> 00:23:09.462
bin ikh gelign in a shpitol

00:23:09.462 --> 00:23:13.256
v- ir hot epes kinder? yo, tsvey kinder, a yingele mit a meydele

00:23:14.427 --> 00:23:17.672
hot di UNK gezogt "IMA, IMA, IMA"

00:23:17.672 --> 00:23:19.519
kh'meg shoyn hobn azan ⟨elter⟩

00:23:19.519 --> 00:23:21.305
vosere kind er iz.

00:23:24.265 --> 00:23:26.267
koved biz aher UNK.

00:23:30.036 --> 00:23:33.017
vos kenstu dertseyltn oyf dayn

00:23:33.073 --> 00:23:35.227
fun dayn lebn do in Ashkelon?

00:23:37.022 --> 00:23:41.639
do in Ashkelon, vos kon ikh aykh dertseyln? ikh hob nit gehat do keyn shum tsores

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:44.199
funem ershtn tog vos ikh bin arayngekumen

00:23:44.199 --> 00:23:45.617
hot er gearbet

00:23:45.617 --> 00:23:47.059
bay tog un bay nakht.

00:23:47.059 --> 00:23:52.406
er hot nit gevust fun keyn shabes, fun keyn ROSH HASHANA, UNK YOM KIPUR, gornit.

00:23:52.598 --> 00:23:57.874
m'hot gevust bay nakht tsu geyn un bay nakht tsu kumen, UNK zol zayn in shtub vos me darf.

00:23:57.981 --> 00:24:02.295
a shver lebn, shver iz geven, shtark shver. UNK nisht geholfn

00:24:04.107 --> 00:24:08.303
UNK gute vort farshraybt ales, fartraybt ales.

00:24:14.687 --> 00:24:15.744
un

00:24:17.421 --> 00:24:19.772
du kenst dikh dermonen fun

00:24:19.772 --> 00:24:21.096
yene tsaytn

00:24:21.096 --> 00:24:22.548
fun CHAGIM

00:24:22.548 --> 00:24:25.667
shabes, vi iz dos geven bay aykh in shtub?

00:24:25.352 --> 00:24:26.966
un Rumenye?

00:24:26.382 --> 00:24:27.203
yo.

00:24:28.255 --> 00:24:31.888
bay UNK baben gevoynt, gekhovet gevorn

00:24:31.888 --> 00:24:35.471
yidish, yidish UNK yidish

00:24:36.253 --> 00:24:40.314
UNK milekh tsi fleyshiks. es iz alding parve.

00:24:42.717 --> 00:24:44.095
kedey me zol

00:24:42.750 --> 00:24:46.017
un oyf di yontoyvim, vos gedenkstu fun

00:24:45.838 --> 00:24:46.895
vi azoy?

00:24:47.037 --> 00:24:51.452
yontoyvim oder shabes, vos gedenkst fun di tsaytn?

00:24:51.829 --> 00:24:53.459
vos zol ikh gedenken?

00:24:53.459 --> 00:24:58.979
di babe iz geven a baleboste un shtub, un der zeyde iz geven a khosid baym reb- baym altn rebn, dem altn.

00:25:00.300 --> 00:25:05.730
un z- zey hobn gehat a groysn tish oyf dem yontoyvim? v- vos iz geven in shtub?

00:25:04.857 --> 00:25:11.128
di babe iz geven ⟨a orem in shtub⟩ UNK alte, tsvey mentshn, eltere tsvey mentshn. vos hobn zey gekont hobn?

00:25:11.134 --> 00:25:16.342
nisht far keynem gezogt gevorn, a gebrokhn harts fun dray tekhter tsu hobn eyniklekh

00:25:16.416 --> 00:25:19.937
iz dos m- ⟨mir⟩ gekhovet, un gekhovet nokh a eynikl

00:25:20.365 --> 00:25:25.900
fun dray yor a kind vos zi hot dergangen dem, dem, do UNK

00:25:25.900 --> 00:25:27.095
dinen

00:25:27.095 --> 00:25:32.166
hot er gezogt er vil nisht dinen in Rumenye. er vil forn keyn Rusland. UNK

00:25:32.166 --> 00:25:35.935
iz er avek nokh dortn, i- d- nokh dortn, dort geblibn.

00:25:37.712 --> 00:25:39.970
un do in shtub, in land

00:25:39.970 --> 00:25:41.599
hot ir gehat

00:25:42.771 --> 00:25:44.034
hot ir

00:25:44.260 --> 00:25:46.990
in di yontoyvim un shabes iz

00:25:46.990 --> 00:25:47.578
hot ir

00:25:46.993 --> 00:25:49.349
bay m- bay mir shabes iz shabes.

00:25:49.033 --> 00:25:49.793
yo?

00:25:49.373 --> 00:25:50.720
shabes ver ikh

00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:52.837
a gantse vokh iz a gantse vokh

00:25:52.837 --> 00:25:55.284
le- lebt men. me shtarbt kholile nit

00:25:55.284 --> 00:25:58.887
nor fraytik tsvelef, halb eyns, shoyn di tish gegreyt

00:25:58.887 --> 00:26:02.735
un di likht iz oyfn tish, un di khale mitn khale dekl ibergedekt

00:26:02.735 --> 00:26:05.831
biz bay di, bay, di tikhele ongegreyt

00:26:05.831 --> 00:26:08.604
UNK in top ⟨ot⟩ unter di likht, bay di likht

00:26:09.538 --> 00:26:13.481
me darf bentshn likht, kukt er oyfn luekh, v- bay vosere sho

00:26:14.145 --> 00:26:19.184
UNK me darf bentshn UNK ⟨ontsutun⟩ di likht, gey ikh UNK bentshn likht.

00:26:19.782 --> 00:26:22.999
un in yontoyvim, bistu gegangen in BET KNESET?

00:26:22.819 --> 00:26:23.825
vi azoy?

00:26:23.022 --> 00:26:24.821
in yontoyvim

00:26:25.452 --> 00:26:28.044
in dem CHAGIM, in di yontoyvim

00:26:27.780 --> 00:26:28.668
nu?

00:26:28.472 --> 00:26:30.980
bistu gegangen in BET KNESET?

00:26:30.617 --> 00:26:32.357
BETACH, BETACH.

00:26:32.387 --> 00:26:35.924
az ikh kon nokh davenen aleyn. haynt ze ikh nisht

00:26:36.083 --> 00:26:38.248
haynt az ikh darf zogn yizker

00:26:38.248 --> 00:26:39.738
zog ikh oysnveynik.

00:26:41.078 --> 00:26:43.941
ikh nem di tkhine in der haynt, ober ikh leyen nit.

00:26:43.963 --> 00:26:46.685
oyf dem ze ikh nisht shoyn tsvelef yor

00:26:46.685 --> 00:26:48.446
un dos kumt nokh.

00:26:52.080 --> 00:26:53.373
un yetst

00:26:53.481 --> 00:26:56.512
kumen di eyniklekh un di

00:26:55.708 --> 00:26:57.136
ven un ven.

00:26:57.143 --> 00:26:58.791
ven un ven kumen zey.

00:26:59.033 --> 00:27:00.928
az ikh hob gezen

00:27:00.928 --> 00:27:07.582
flegn oyf a shabes kumen, flegn eyn mol in der vokhn kumen, yontev kumen, s'iz geven ongegreyt ales

00:27:07.943 --> 00:27:10.940
nisht breyt, ober balebatish.

00:27:11.048 --> 00:27:11.919
haynt

00:27:12.195 --> 00:27:15.327
kokh ikh op a tepl, iz shver vegn undz oykhet

00:27:16.195 --> 00:27:19.868
darf ikh leygn in te- tepl, fleg ikh leygn in tepl

00:27:19.907 --> 00:27:21.707
darf ikh gisn ⟨dem⟩ tepl

00:27:21.707 --> 00:27:26.067
gis ikh mit der gaz farlozt, UNK tsu hobn gaz

00:27:34.318 --> 00:27:35.088
iz

00:27:36.985 --> 00:27:40.168
du g- du geyst a mol tsu, tsu di kinder?

00:27:40.208 --> 00:27:41.197
yo.

00:27:41.727 --> 00:27:46.496
yo, befor mit yorn ⟨fleg men undz⟩ nemen a sakh mol, a sakh mol

00:27:46.654 --> 00:27:49.517
kumen fraytik mit zeyer mashin undz nemen

00:27:49.624 --> 00:27:52.790
sh- zuntik oder shabeysenakhts aheymbrengen

00:27:52.797 --> 00:27:54.343
UNK kon nisht zogn ⟨mer⟩

00:27:56.138 --> 00:28:00.384
UNK geven a UNK tsu ⟨neyen⟩.

00:28:00.070 --> 00:28:02.342
un vifl kinder hobn zey?

00:28:02.382 --> 00:28:04.890
der zun, vifl kinder hot er?

00:28:03.900 --> 00:28:04.974
fir.

00:28:05.520 --> 00:28:07.049
di tokhter dray.

00:28:07.242 --> 00:28:09.058
du gedenkst di nemener?

00:28:09.216 --> 00:28:12.385
yo. SAVTA, SAVTA, SAVTA.

00:28:12.385 --> 00:28:14.728
kh'hob ⟨geholfn⟩ di kinder.

00:28:17.046 --> 00:28:19.810
du gedenkst di nemener fun di kinder?

00:28:19.189 --> 00:28:20.583
yo, vos den?

00:28:20.354 --> 00:28:22.084
nu, UNK zog.

00:28:21.147 --> 00:28:24.128
dem UNK ⟨dinst⟩ meydl ⟨der⟩ groyse

00:28:24.403 --> 00:28:25.494
DALIT

00:28:26.007 --> 00:28:27.218
di andere

00:28:27.218 --> 00:28:27.857
n-

00:28:28.926 --> 00:28:30.607
di andere NIRA

00:28:30.647 --> 00:28:31.586
shoyn

00:28:31.947 --> 00:28:32.501
ZEHU.
